normative_requirement_audit.original_requirement:
Turn this proposed budget/replay skeleton into measured fixture specifications before dispatch. The numbers are engineering targets, not observed results; the actions require native workflow evidence in their delivery stages. Use this standalone illustrative acceptance example to refine the actual production API and regression; it is not an already implemented Lince interface or sufficient milestone evidence.

  ```rust
  fn main() {
      let coarse_earth_bytes = 32_u64 * 1024 * 1024;
      let fixture_limit_bytes = 64_u64 * 1024 * 1024;
      let automatic_cache_limit_bytes = 128_u64 * 1024 * 1024;
      assert!(coarse_earth_bytes <= fixture_limit_bytes);
      assert!(fixture_limit_bytes <= automatic_cache_limit_bytes);
      let required_actions = [
          "inspect_ball",
          "leave_building",
          "walk_street",
          "view_globe",
          "view_optional_outer_context",
          "return_to_same_ball",
          "repeat_without_geographic_profile",
          "revoke_guest",
      ];
      assert_eq!(required_actions.len(), 8);
  }
  ```
